    findings: ["Recurrence hazard ratio 7.0 postoperatively and 50.8 after adjuvant chemotherapy.", "80% of postoperatively ctDNA-positive patients relapsed despite chemotherapy; only permanent clearers did not.", "Two growth rates, 25% and 143% increase a month, with the rate prognostic (hazard ratio 2.7)."],
