    findings: ["Extended RAS (KRAS and NRAS exons 2, 3 and 4) testing is required before EGFR antibody therapy.", "BRAF V600 testing for prognosis and, with mismatch repair, for Lynch syndrome evaluation.", "Mismatch repair status should be determined on all colorectal cancers."],
